---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="LGBTQ+ Lesbian & Sapphic Group Trips in Latin America | Queerness Experiences" description={"LGBTQ+ lesbian and sapphic group trips in Latin America, including the Luxury Lesbians Retreat and Camp Queerness. Tulum now, Mexico City coming soon. Led by someone born in Mexico and raised between two cultures. For lesbian, sapphic, gay, bi, trans, queer, and LGBTQ+ travelers, families, and destination weddings who want the real thing."}>

<header class="head">
  <div class="shape-y"></div>
  <p class="head-eye">★ Sapphic, Queer &amp; Trans Group Trips · Latin America</p>
  <h1>Trips that actually<br>make it out of<br>the group chat.</h1>
  <p>For sapphic, queer, and trans people excited to travel while prioritizing local businesses and local projects along the way. Created by Santi Solis, a queer, bilingual, and bicultural group trip creator. Being bicultural is what lets me bridge both worlds for travelers ready to make real connections when they travel to Latin America and experience Mexican culture from a local's perspective. Tulum now, Mexico City coming soon.</p>
</header>

<section style="background:var(--white);padding:var(--s-lg) var(--s-sm);max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;">
  <div class="trips-about-inner">
    <div class="trips-about-text">
      <p class="sec-eye">What these trips actually are</p>
      <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);">These trips start by interacting with the culture and learning the specific, nuanced, charming details that make Latin culture so special, not just seeing the sights: the song that gets everyone singing in the middle of the street the second it plays, the dance moves that show up at every wedding and every social gathering, the decorations that make us feel connected to generations before us. Making you feel more connected to the people you meet, and to yourself. I think that's important.</p>
      <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--dark);">Hi, I'm Santi. I'm Mexican, born in Mexico, raised in the U.S., and I've been living in Tulum for almost ten years. People in Latin America have a special way of creating space for others, and I think every queer person deserves to experience that. I want to bring that back into queer community.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="trips-about-grid">
      <img src="/images/group-trips-photo.jpg" alt="A group smiling together on a Queerness Experiences trip in Tulum">
      <img src="/images/IMG_4652.jpeg" alt="Friends swimming through the mangroves in Tulum">
      <img src="/images/hero-grid-cenote-friends.jpg" alt="Friends laughing together at a cenote in Tulum">
      <img src="/images/IMG_0477.jpeg" alt="A couple laughing together on a jungle trail in Tulum">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="trips">

  <!-- QUEER CONNECT — CONFIRMED -->
  <div class="trip">
    <div class="trip-photo">
      <img class="trip-photo-img" src="/images/group-trips-photo.jpg" alt="A group smiling together on a dock during a Queerness Experiences group trip in Tulum">
      <span class="trip-status status-confirmed">Booking now · January</span>
    </div>
    <div class="trip-body">
      <div class="trip-partner">In collaboration with Queer Connect</div>
      <div class="trip-name">Queer Connect · Tulum</div>
      <p class="trip-desc">A queer group trip to Tulum, co-hosted with Queer Connect. Cenotes, jungle, food, and the parts of Tulum most visitors never find, with a local co-host who actually lives here. Come solo or bring your people.</p>
      <div class="trip-detail">
        <span class="detail-pill">Tulum</span>
        <span class="detail-pill">January</span>
        <span class="detail-pill">Co-hosted</span>
      </div>
      <div class="trip-foot">
        <a href="https://queer-connect.travel/trips/trans-nonbinary-group-trip-tulum/" class="btn-trip" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See the Trip →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- LUXURY LESBIANS — COMING SOON -->
  <div class="trip">
    <div class="trip-photo">
      <img class="trip-photo-img" src="/images/luxury-lesbians-lagoon.jpg" alt="Hammocks floating over turquoise lagoon water near Tulum">
      <span class="trip-status status-soon">Coming soon</span>
    </div>
    <div class="trip-body">
      <div class="trip-name">Luxury Lesbians Retreat</div>
      <p class="trip-desc">A highly curated, exclusive retreat for lesbian, sapphic, queer, and trans professionals 30+. Zero planning on your end: luxury accommodations and elevated experiences, fully done for you.</p>
      <div class="trip-detail">
        <span class="detail-pill">Coming 2027</span>
        <span class="detail-pill">Details soon</span>
      </div>
      <div class="trip-foot">
        <a href="/waitlist?trip=luxury-lesbians-retreat" class="btn-trip-wait">Join the Waitlist →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CAMP QUEERNESS — COMING SOON -->
  <div class="trip">
    <div class="trip-photo">
      <img class="trip-photo-img" src="/images/camp-queerness-picnic.jpg" alt="Friends painting together over a spread of fresh fruit in the jungle near Tulum">
      <span class="trip-status status-soon">Coming soon</span>
    </div>
    <div class="trip-body">
      <div class="trip-name">Camp Queerness</div>
      <p class="trip-desc">Recreating summer camp, but this time, it's queer. One hundred percent fun and play, going back to camp, all grown up. For anyone who's done the all-inclusive resort thing and realized that's not what they actually wanted.</p>
      <div class="trip-detail">
        <span class="detail-pill">Coming 2027</span>
        <span class="detail-pill">Details soon</span>
      </div>
      <div class="trip-foot">
        <a href="/waitlist?trip=camp-queerness" class="btn-trip-wait">Join the Waitlist →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>

<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="faq" id="faq">
  <p class="sec-eye">Before you book</p>
  <h2>Questions about<br>group trips</h2>
  <div class="faq-list">
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq1" checked>
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq1">Who can join a group trip?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">These trips are specifically for sapphic, queer, and trans travelers, not open to everyone.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq2">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq2">How is a group trip different from a tour?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Tours are single-day experiences with just your group. Group trips are multi-day and bring together travelers who don't already know each other yet, for a shared trip full of new places and new people.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq3">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq3">How is this different from other queer and sapphic group trips?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Right now I focus specifically on Latin America. I'm the founder, based in Mexico, and I'm bicultural, not just bilingual. That means you get to experience Mexico as if you had a local friend guiding you every step of the way.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq4">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq4">Do you host trips outside Tulum?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Not yet, but I have plans for a climbing trip in San Cristóbal de las Casas, plus trips to Colombia and Argentina, coming soon. If there's anywhere else you're interested in, let me know.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq5">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq5">Can you help organize a group trip?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Yes. I can help you create a whole itinerary, connect you with local businesses, private chefs, activities, and experiences, or we can co-host.</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- HOST CTA -->
<section class="host">
  <p class="host-eye">Bringing your group to Tulum?</p>
  <h2>Let's plan it<br>together</h2>
  <p>I offer consulting on different things to do, or I can help you plan the whole trip out, focused on local businesses and local experiences. Raised between two cultures, I can introduce your group to the friends I actually have here and the places I believe in. If that sounds like a fit, let's chat.</p>
  <a href="#" class="btn-host">Let's Talk →</a>
</section>

</Layout>

<style is:global>
@font-face{font-family:'CheddarGothicStencil';src:url('/fonts/CheddarGothicStencil.woff2') format('woff2');font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-display:swap;}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
html{overflow-x:hidden;max-width:100vw;}
:root{
  --magenta:#C8185A;--yellow:#F5A623;--terra:#B5390F;--dark:#1a1a18;
  --white:#FDFCF9;--bone:#F5F0E8;--muted:#4A4034;--border:rgba(26,26,24,0.12);
  --s-sm:16px;--s-md:32px;--s-lg:64px;
  --ff:'Archivo Black','Space Grotesk',sans-serif;--fb:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;
}
body{background:var(--bone);color:var(--dark);font-family:var(--fb);font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden;}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}

/* HEADER */
.head{background:var(--terra);padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm) var(--s-lg);position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
.shape-y{position:absolute;top:0;right:0;width:40%;height:50%;background:var(--yellow);clip-path:polygon(28% 0,100% 0,100% 100%,0 100%);z-index:0;}
.head-eye{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);position:relative;z-index:2;}
.head h1{font-family:var(--ff);font-size:40px;line-height:0.96;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--white);position:relative;z-index:2;-webkit-text-stroke:1.5px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);paint-order:stroke fill;margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);}
.head p{font-size:14.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);line-height:1.7;position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:520px;}

/* TRIPS */
.trips{padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm) var(--s-lg);}
.trip{border:3px solid var(--dark);margin-bottom:var(--s-md);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--dark);overflow:hidden;background:var(--white);}
.trip-photo{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(26,26,24,0.05),rgba(26,26,24,0.05) 12px,rgba(26,26,24,0.09) 12px,rgba(26,26,24,0.09) 24px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(26,26,24,0.4);text-align:center;padding:12px;border-bottom:3px solid var(--dark);position:relative;}
.trip-photo-img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;}
.trip-status{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;font-family:var(--fb);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:5px 10px;border-right:3px solid var(--dark);border-bottom:3px solid var(--dark);}
.status-confirmed{background:var(--magenta);color:var(--white);}
.status-soon{background:var(--yellow);color:var(--dark);}
.trip-body{padding:20px;}
.trip-partner{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--magenta);margin-bottom:6px;}
.trip-name{font-family:var(--ff);font-size:26px;color:var(--dark);text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1;margin-bottom:12px;}
.trip-desc{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);}
.trip-detail{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);}
.detail-pill{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 10px;background:var(--bone);border:2px solid var(--dark);color:var(--dark);}
.trip-foot{border-top:2px solid var(--border);padding-top:14px;}
.btn-trip{display:inline-block;background:var(--magenta);color:var(--white);font-family:var(--fb);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.05em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:11px 18px;border:2px solid var(--dark);box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--dark);}
.btn-trip-wait{display:inline-block;background:var(--white);color:var(--dark);font-family:var(--fb);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.05em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:11px 18px;border:2px solid var(--dark);box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--dark);}

/* HOST CTA — for organizers */
.host{background:var(--dark);padding:var(--s-lg) var(--s-sm);}
.host-eye{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--yellow);margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);}
.host h2{font-family:var(--ff);font-size:30px;color:var(--white);text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1;margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);}
.host p{font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:var(--s-md);max-width:520px;}
.btn-host{display:inline-block;background:var(--yellow);color:var(--dark);font-family:var(--fb);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.05em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:15px 28px;border:3px solid var(--yellow);}

footer{background:var(--dark);padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm);border-top:3px solid var(--yellow);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--s-sm);}
.flogo{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--magenta);line-height:1.15;}
.flinks{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:var(--s-sm);list-style:none;}
.flinks a{font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);}
.trips-about-inner{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--s-md);}
.trips-about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;}
.trips-about-grid img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:cover;border:3px solid var(--dark);}
.trips-about-grid img:nth-child(1){transform:rotate(-2deg);}
.trips-about-grid img:nth-child(2){transform:rotate(1.5deg);margin-top:14px;}
.trips-about-grid img:nth-child(3){transform:rotate(1deg);margin-top:-10px;}
.trips-about-grid img:nth-child(4){transform:rotate(-1.5deg);}

@media(min-width:720px){
  nav{padding:0 40px;}
  .head{padding:var(--s-lg) 40px;}
  .head h1{font-size:60px;}
  .trips{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:28px;align-items:start;padding:var(--s-md) 40px var(--s-lg);max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;}
  .trip{margin-bottom:0;}
  .trips-about-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 440px;gap:48px;align-items:center;}
  .host{padding:var(--s-lg) 40px;}
  footer{flex-direction:row;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:var(--s-md) 40px;}
}
</style>
